WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.926 --> 00:00:02.882
(birds chirping)

00:00:02.882 --> 00:00:04.549
- [Anthony] Aliens.

00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:07.275
Jellyfish.

00:00:09.763 --> 00:00:10.930
Bursting suns.

00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:15.404
That all is immaterial to me.

00:00:16.926 --> 00:00:18.902
I don't really want them
to be like anything,

00:00:18.902 --> 00:00:23.069
I want them to be like nothing
else you've seen before.

00:00:26.922 --> 00:00:29.713
My name is Anthony Howe,
I'm a kinetic wind sculptor

00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:32.796
residing on Orcas Island, Washington.

00:00:41.031 --> 00:00:42.689
The unifying element to all of my work

00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:46.856
is that the outdoor stuff
is all powered by the wind.

00:00:47.796 --> 00:00:51.962
(gentle chiming music)

00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:53.485
I don't have a gallery

00:00:53.485 --> 00:00:56.917
and haven't had one for about 30 years.

00:00:56.917 --> 00:01:00.455
My wife and I have run the
whole business ourselves

00:01:00.455 --> 00:01:04.202
without agents or
galleries or consultants.

00:01:04.202 --> 00:01:07.473
Most of the people that see my work,

00:01:07.473 --> 00:01:09.556
see it on YouTube videos.

00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:14.004
A large scale piece will
generally start at say,

00:01:14.004 --> 00:01:17.254
$45,000, $50,000, and go up to, um, $400,000

00:01:18.498 --> 00:01:21.664
if it's a really big sculpture.

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:26.331
But that's the kind of piece
that takes a long time to make

00:01:26.331 --> 00:01:30.414
and extracts a lot of
physical ability out of me.

00:01:35.148 --> 00:01:38.315
(upbeat gentle music)

00:01:45.096 --> 00:01:46.731
What I'm trying to do with the work

00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:51.180
is cause people to stop
whatever thought process

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.097
they have in their head

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.438
and just for a moment experience

00:01:57.438 --> 00:01:59.286
a different kind of reality.

00:01:59.286 --> 00:02:01.875
Maybe more meditative.

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:05.003
They work, they take people
out of whatever nonsense

00:02:05.003 --> 00:02:06.998
is going on in their heads.

00:02:06.998 --> 00:02:09.231
Puts them in a different place.

00:02:09.231 --> 00:02:11.294
It's a feeling you get
when you see something

00:02:11.294 --> 00:02:14.317
that is very beautiful or unusual.

00:02:14.317 --> 00:02:17.979
That's what I'm trying
to do with the work.

00:02:17.979 --> 00:02:21.146
(gentle upbeat music)

